      "10": {
        "name": "CTRL9",
        "access": "RW",
        "width": 1,
        "description": "主机命令寄存器。写入预定义命令值执行 CTRL9 协议；命令完成后 STATUSINT.ctrl9_cmd_done 置位，主机需写入 CTRL_CMD_ACK(0x00) 结束协议",
        "roles": [
          "host_command"
        ],
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "command",
            "bits": "7:0",
            "description": "CTRL9 命令值\n0x00 = CTRL_CMD_ACK：确认命令完成并结束协议\n0x04 = CTRL_CMD_RST_FIFO：复位 FIFO\n0x05 = CTRL_CMD_REQ_FIFO：请求读取 FIFO 数据\n0x08 = CTRL_CMD_WRITE_WOM_SETTING：配置并使能运动唤醒（Wake on Motion）\n0x09 = CTRL_CMD_ACCEL_HOST_DELTA_OFFSET：修改加速度计偏移\n0x0A = CTRL_CMD_GYRO_HOST_DELTA_OFFSET：修改陀螺仪偏移\n0x0C = CTRL_CMD_CONFIGURE_TAP：配置 Tap 检测\n0x0D = CTRL_CMD_CONFIGURE_PEDOMETER：配置计步器\n0x0E = CTRL_CMD_CONFIGURE_MOTION：配置任意运动、无运动和显著运动检测\n0x0F = CTRL_CMD_RESET_PEDOMETER：复位计步器步数\n0x10 = CTRL_CMD_COPY_USID：复制 USID 和固件版本到 UI 寄存器\n0x11 = CTRL_CMD_SET_RPU：配置 IO 上拉电阻\n0x12 = CTRL_CMD_AHB_CLOCK_GATING：配置内部 AHB 时钟门控\n0xA2 = CTRL_CMD_ON_DEMAND_CALIBRATION：执行陀螺仪按需校准\n0xAA = CTRL_CMD_APPLY_GYRO_GAINS：恢复已保存的陀螺仪增益",
            "roles": [
              "host_command_value"
            ],
            "event": null,
            "ignore_by_default": false
          }
        ]
      },
